OL,3,GNEWSALandlord finds 'absolutely        
OL,4,Ashocking' scenes after tenant wrecks   
OL,5,Aproperty                               
OL,7,FA landlord said she was left "in shock"
OL,8,Fafter her tenant left her home in "an  
OL,9,Fabsolute mess", including dog poo all  
OL,10,Fover the house.                        
OL,12,FIsabelle Williams, 24, said she could  
OL,13,Fnot believe what she was faced with as 
OL,14,Fshe opened the door to her property in 
OL,15,FNewcastle Emlyn, Carmarthenshire, on   
OL,16,FTuesday.                               
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
