OL,3,GNEWSALandlord finds 'absolutely        
OL,4,Ashocking' scenes after tenant wrecks   
OL,5,Aproperty                               
OL,7,FThe self-employed carpenter and tiler  
OL,8,Fsaid dog mess was "everywhere" and all 
OL,9,Fof the furniture was damaged. Now,     
OL,10,FIsabelle wants to see more support for 
OL,11,Flandlords in Wales who face similar    
OL,12,Fissues with their tenants.             
OL,14,FBBC Wales tried calling the tenant for 
OL,15,Fa response using the phone number      
OL,16,Fprovided by the landlord, but the      
OL,17,Fnumber no longer exists.               
